## 📖 About the Project

**Scientific Calculator** is a Java-based desktop application developed to strengthen practical knowledge of **GUI development**, **Java Swing**, **event handling**, and **Object-Oriented Programming**.

The application provides a user-friendly graphical interface where users can perform arithmetic calculations through interactive buttons, making it an excellent demonstration of Java desktop application development.

---

## ✨ Features

* 🖥️ Interactive Java Swing GUI
* 🔢 Button-based numeric input
* ➕ Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication & Division
* 🧹 Clear (C) button to reset input
* ⬅️ Backspace/Delete functionality
* ⚡ Event-driven programming using Action Listeners
* 🎨 Clean and beginner-friendly interface
* 💻 Lightweight desktop application

